---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'
import { site } from '../site'
---
<Base title="About" description="Who I am and what this site is.">
  <p class="section-label">about</p>
  <p>
    I'm Jacek Becela. I've been programming for most of my life and spent a large
    part of it building <a href="https://trixbrix.eu">TrixBrix</a> — a company that
    manufactures physical products.
  </p>
  <p>
    I like software, machines, production, old computers, AI, and understanding how
    things work. This site is where I put the things I make and the things I find
    out along the way.
  </p>
  <p>
    Born in 1980. Husband and father of two boys.
  </p>
  <p class="section-label">open source</p>
  <p>Some patches of mine that landed in other people's projects:</p>
  <ul class="postlist">
    <li>
      <span class="date">2008</span>
      <span><strong>Rails</strong> — <a href="https://github.com/rails/rails/commit/a7ea06b4ebe252e258f83e7de945b4baa30ec3bc">render shorthands for namespaced controllers</a>, <a href="https://github.com/rails/rails/commit/86a042ddd9dba8f62e7328c7258a798aef73d57f">consistent plugin initialization</a>, <a href="https://github.com/rails/rails/commit/697ee1a50dea7580a7240535d3ad89d2d090721a">fixtures from arbitrary paths</a></span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="date">2010</span>
      <span><strong>Node.js</strong> — <a href="https://github.com/nodejs/node/commit/548d59d07e21a54fb869345ff71ed08cbe2ffad1">fix fs.readFile encoding handling</a></span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="date">2010</span>
      <span><strong>formidable</strong> — <a href="https://github.com/node-formidable/formidable/commit/4800b7f8283047c1bc86fcba9c4a379ef7efd1fd">stop the multipart parser at the last boundary</a></span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="date">2011</span>
      <span><strong>Backbone.js</strong> — <a href="https://github.com/jashkenas/backbone/commit/1499d755b62a7a57ac71356b3cc0999349504da2">guard against a missing model</a>, failing test first</span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="date">2012</span>
      <span><strong>Sidekiq</strong> — <a href="https://github.com/sidekiq/sidekiq/commit/aa564003795f7dcd154430644cb4950abf0864db">keep the scheduler alive through Redis connection errors</a></span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="date">2025</span>
      <span><strong>Omarchy</strong> — <a href="https://github.com/basecamp/omarchy/commit/c49941381214426041e20203cecf75f31736a568">one keybinding for the top bar toggle</a></span>
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>The gap in the middle is when the train factory happened.</p>
  <p>
    You can write me at <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> or find my
    code on <a href={site.github}>GitHub</a>.
  </p>
</Base>
